003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The 18th is a hard cut-off, not a target.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Submit one file per team, listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Submit one file per team, listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and are applied to the following month.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and are applied to the following month.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team and keep the file.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Do not send totals in the body of an email.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Reference states a different deadline of 12:00 on the 18th, not 15:00 on the 20th.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Submissions that arrive after it are held for the following month's run.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"This general behavior is stated regardless of the specific cut-off time referenced.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"the cut-off moves to the last working day before it\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Reference states the cut-off moves to the last working day before it, not to the following Monday.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Submit one file per team, listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"This submission requirement matches regardless of the specific date referenced.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly st